WEBVTT

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:11.840
Sera?

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.880
Or Akasaki?

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.510
Or?

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.010
What are you doing, Natsuki?! Make up your mind!

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:26.480
Pass it here, Hauer!

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:28.770
Go make some space!

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.770
Bastard!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.200
Good job, Sugie!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.120
We stopped Osaka's attacks!

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.750
I guess you've learnt, Sugie.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.250
I guess now the problem is him.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.500
You mean Natsuki?

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.280
Maybe it's because I said that to him before the game.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.320
Huh? What did you say to Natsuki?

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.510
Hmm?

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.010
I told him...

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:08.010
that he lacks resolve as a forward.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:45.370
Good. I'm good.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:51.000
Just now, I took a while to decide on my next move.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.540
I'll get it right next time.

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.150
It's okay.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.580
I'm just not used to it,

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.550
but it'll come to me in a bit.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:09.230
Yes... I've grown!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.060
I can be an excellent forward who has a good overview of the pitch!

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:17.060
I hope so... eventually.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:22.040
But that Gino!

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:30.830
His eyes! He totally looked down on me.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.840
We're of the same age. What's with that attitude?

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:41.760
But when Gino acts like that, he usually doesn't give me the ball anymore...

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.680
No, no!

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.100
Gino should have noticed it too!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.720
I've changed!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:54.220
Right, manager?!

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:59.150
Whether it's resolve as a forward or other qualities...

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.600
I have them all!

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.110
I'll show you!

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.490
I hit myself too hard...

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.710
I-Is he alright, that Natsuki...

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.000
Who knows?

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.250
I'm fine.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.750
I can do this.

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:25.510
I realized today, before the match...

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:30.030
My... potential.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.760
Alright, we're going to leave soon!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:38.560
Please get on the bus as soon as you're ready.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.690
Is everybody here?

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:42.270
Um, Yuri.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:48.780
Natsuki and, uhh, the manager aren't here.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:54.780
Where the hell did those two go?!

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:05.920
The Osaka match is finally here. I'm fired up!

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.630
But, in order to play well,

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:13.310
I'll have to do some image training before the match.

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:15.180
Okay.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:25.160
There I am, looking cool. I'm in top form!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.590
The ball goes to Gino, probably the most handsome guy after me.

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:36.400
He's just acting cool, which is why I'm the number one!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:40.940
Oops, that's irrelevant.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.460
Focus, focus.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.130
Ahh, there's my fast movement!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.010
I'm aiming for an emphatic super volley!

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.890
And here comes the perfect pass from Gino!

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.850
Wait, let's rewind that again...

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:05.600
As I bravely tussle at the front line, I found space to run into!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:08.280
Gino passes!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:11.940
Hey!

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:14.100
Image

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.360
No! I just need to rewind a bit to get it right.
Image

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:17.870
Image

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.630
What is this? Gino passing to me...

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.090
I simply can't imagine it.

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:45.020
Why?! Give me a pass, Gino!

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:48.980
I always thought you were weird,

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:54.780
but you're just downright creepy, Natsuki.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:01.500
T-This is so embarrassing! Don't look!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.290
This is creepy too.

00:07:07.060 --> 00:07:11.050
It's not like this is totally new.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:18.050
I realised that Gino has stopped passing the ball to me.

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:25.300
At first, I thought he was just jealous of my great potential.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.270
But that wasn't it.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:35.280
He doesn't like forwards like me who just shoot on sight.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.690
Even if I score a goal,

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:42.410
he'll say that the flow wasn't good, that it lacks elegance or something.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.880
Well, it can't be helped.

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:50.420
I'm just weak. I'm the type of forward who requires others to feed the ball to me.

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.170
Hey, here Gino!

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:58.600
Great! Push forward, Akasaki!

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:05.520
That Gino! Blatantly making a disgruntled face.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.770
Just you watch!

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.840
I'll handle the ball carefully. The flow... Observe the flow!

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:21.030
Hey, Natsuki, what's your definition of a forward?

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:32.830
A-A forward is someone who shoots and scores goals.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:42.090
For me, a forward's the closest to the goal out of the 11 players.

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.300
Nothing more.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:46.310
Huh?

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:50.620
In football, anyone can score a goal.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.910
There's no rule that it has to be a forward.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:02.470
Though, like I just mentioned, the forward is the closest to the opponent's goal.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.030
In Gino's case,

00:09:05.550 --> 00:09:08.070
The balls you receive at the front line...

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:13.450
Well, they're all sent to you from the very hearts of your teammates.

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:17.280
What is that ball to you?

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:19.980
Is it the team's ball?

00:09:20.670 --> 00:09:22.090
Or is it your ball?

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:29.640
Natsuki, you lack the resolve as a forward.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:35.480
You should make up your mind about that as soon as possible.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:38.670
The team's ball?

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.590
Or mine?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:50.000
That's...

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:52.500
Manager.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:02.260
I've made up my mind. I'll try it!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:04.910
Huh?

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.890
To me, that ball is...

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:17.590
A chance! Pass it to Natsuki, Akasaki!

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.130
Komuro...

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:23.150
If I overcome this olympic player...

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:27.620
it'll mean that I'm qualified to be a national player, too!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:32.830
Ok!

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.070
It went through!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.710
But the angle's tight!

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.710
Hey!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:41.340
Sera is free. Natsuki!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.220
What is that ball to you?

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.380
The answer is obvious, Coach.

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:57.230
This is the team's ball.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:01.600
The goalkeeper blocks the ball, the defenders secure it,

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:06.090
the midfielders battle the opponents to bring it all the way here.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.740
It's the team's ball.

00:11:08.530 --> 00:11:11.520
I can't say that this is my ball.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.200
The forward is also a member of the team.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.910
It doesn't matter who scores the goal.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:22.560
I'm a forward with a good overview of the pitch

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:24.380
so I can fully utilise my teammate's potential.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.940
Nice, goal kick. A gift.

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:43.530
Geez, what are you doing, Natsu?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.530
Hey! Come on, Natsuki!

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:52.150
That idiot. Does he even want to win?

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:57.160
Macchan, make the subs warm up seriously.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:01.000
Uh, sure. You're subbing him off?

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:02.900
Natsuki can't do it.

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:05.150
It's starting to get boring.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.500
If a player with doubts gets on the field,

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.660
the team will be infected with something bad.

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:16.070
I misjudged him.

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:18.180
This is my mistake.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:24.110
ETU's offense is destroying itself.

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:29.240
I suppose you can say that this is a result of our pressure.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:32.610
At this rate we won't have anything to worry about.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:35.700
We still have control of the game,

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.450
Dulfer.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.710
Manager?

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:48.380
Oh, that's true, Sonoda. The ball's still in our court.

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:52.760
However, that's exactly why we should take the initiative!

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:55.850
If we rely on our lead and just sit back,

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:59.310
the flow of the game will change eventually.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:05.980
In order to win, you have to be decisive.

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:08.610
Manager...

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:15.500
I can't see us scoring!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.410
I think it's Natsuki.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:23.390
Though he screws up a lot, his eccentricity's what makes things fun.

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:24.320
Yeah.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:31.340
But today, watching Natsuki isn't fun at all.

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.680
Forward...

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.690
that's just a name for a position.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:52.650
Yes?

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:56.610
It's pretty common for a forward to get criticized if he doesn't score.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.950
But I think that's a stupid concept.

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:03.080
Football's compromising.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.630
Uh, yeah...

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:08.940
But you know, every once in a while,

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.340
there is a forward who's self-centred.

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:16.270
For instance,

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.600
there is a ball that your teammates carried all the way to the front lines.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.350
Is this ball the team's ball or the forward's?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.880
So whose is it, Macchan?

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:31.860
Uh... it's the team's ball...

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.360
Correct.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.860
It should be.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:42.720
Most players will answer that way. It's pretty obvious.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.870
But an egoist is different.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.750
They have the guts to think that though it's the team's ball,

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.600
it's also his ball.

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:59.620
To be able to shoulder the hopes of your teammates and yet play for yourself at the same time...

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:03.460
That is the resolve of an egoistic forward.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.170
A forward like that is strong.

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:11.770
Because they have the guts to request for the ball even after they've failed.

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.980
They will try to shoot from anywhere.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.280
That's why they will score more often.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:21.780
I thought that Natsuki might be of that type,

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.090
but if he was intimidated by Gino that easily,

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.310
that means that he isn't.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:39.930
It's already 10 minutes into the 2nd half... It's been tough.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.940
I promised the manager...

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:47.940
that we'd get our 3rd goal within 10 minutes.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.190
This guy's always so cocky.

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.400
I think it's time to fulfill our promise...

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.610
Kubotan!

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:00.180
It's Kubota!

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:00.740
Sugie!

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:10.750
Now, can you shine in the second half like you did in the first, Monsieur Kubota?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:18.010
The 3rd goal. 3rd goal.

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:24.010
Dulfer said that we'd win if we get 3 goals.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:28.550
I've enjoyed myself a lot today.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:33.230
It's been so much fun that we simply have to win.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:37.900
It went to Hatake!

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.780
Well done, Kubo! Nice pass!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.760
Hatake is fast!

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.790
Stop him, Ishihama!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:54.800
Come on, Hatake!

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.790
Hey, watch it!

00:16:56.060 --> 00:16:59.300
They'll play it to Hauer, Kuroda! Block his movement!

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.260
It's Shimura!

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.890
You really think so?!

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:12.480
Great, that's our Murakoshi!

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:13.730
Koshi!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:14.980
Sera!

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.730
Go, counter!

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.860
You morons! I didn't have my turn yet!

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.630
Nice, Katayama!

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:29.580
That's right, Osaka's attacks don't end that easily!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.210
Yup, we still have time.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:39.300
Don't let him go, stop him!

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.180
The fun will continue.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:51.320
I'm so happy while we're attacking.

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:57.330
A forward who's allowed to attack this much really has it all.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:03.920
He got past Sugie!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:06.070
Go, Kubota!

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.200
Score, Kubota!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:18.070
I have to thank Dulfer for converting me to a forward.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:24.160
I'll score the 3rd goal to thank him for that!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:43.120
T-Tsubaki! Nice steal!

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.740
Uh.. um...

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.330
Not yet...

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.700
Go, Tsubaki!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:59.840
Show them your blistering pace!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.970
Go, Tsubaki! Run through!

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:12.930
At least one...

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.270
I have to create at least one chance!

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:18.870
What's that?

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:26.030
He's like the wind. Isn't he my age?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:31.620
Oh no, I have to chase him.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.880
Alright, go!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:53.030
Hiraga, stop him in the centre!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:53.760
Hiraga!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.100
It's okay, we have enough people.

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:02.050
Just come, I'll take it from you here!

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:05.600
Keep going like that, Baki.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:14.030
I'm sure you'll get through. Well, that's because of my sacrifice.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.290
No way!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.010
He can't keep up!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.340
He got past Hiraga! This is our chance!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:35.950
Great! Continue down and cut it back, Tsubaki!

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.940
What's this, what's this?

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:47.650
Am I still worrying about that tight angle from before?

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:53.280
Even if I had shot, it wouldn't have gone in. It was too tight.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:59.410
Forget about it. Being a forward is not just about shooting.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:05.070
I injured myself because I kept trying crazy shots.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.820
It took me 8 months to get back here.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:14.550
I don't want to experience that again!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:22.210
But am I enjoying the match?

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:28.190
You idiot! You don't have time to worry about that!

00:21:28.340 --> 00:21:34.350
I'm a player! I have to contribute to my team at all times!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.790
It doesn't matter what I want to do.

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:39.830
I told you guys.

00:21:40.390 --> 00:21:45.830
The important thing is whether you guys can enjoy the match.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:54.320
Sera's close!

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.050
Go, Tsubaki!

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.230
Natsu!

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:07.400
Shoot already, Natsuki!

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:13.780
Follow your instinct! You're a striker, aren't you?!

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:26.500
Ah, so close!

00:22:26.500 --> 00:22:28.500
It's not over, follow up!

00:22:30.320 --> 00:22:33.010
That's not far enough, get it up front!

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:35.630
Nice, Akasaki!

00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:38.390
Akasaki! Let me shoot!

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:42.890
It's Natsuki! Lima, block Natsuki!

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:46.770
Oh shi-

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:19.320
20 minutes left. ETU's in for a rough time.

00:24:19.320 --> 00:24:22.320
The excellent Kubota's getting subbed.

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:24.610
It's just as we planned!

00:24:24.610 --> 00:24:28.250
How much stamina does this guy have?!
